"혼자 산책하고 앉고 낮잠도 자요. 어울리기를 켜 두면 서로 인사하거나 쫓아다니고, 커서를 쳐다보거나 달려오고, 러그가 있으면 올라가 앉아요." = "They stroll, sit and nap on their own. With Play together on, they greet and chase each other, look at or run to the cursor, and sit on the rug if there is one.";
/* Sources/DogMonitor/UI/DesktopSettingsView.swift:246 */
