/* Sources/DogMonitor/UI/DesktopSettingsView.swift:247 */
"친구들끼리 놀기도 해요. 술래잡기를 켜면 가끔 한 명이 술래가 되어 20초 동안 쫓아다니고, 기차놀이를 켜면 커서 친구 뒤에 줄줄이 붙어 따라가요. 둘 다 어울리기가 켜져 있어야 하고, 오른쪽 클릭 메뉴로 바로 시작할 수도 있어요." = "They play together too. With Tag on, now and then one becomes It and chases the others for 20 seconds. With Train on, they line up behind the cursor friend and follow it. Both need Play together on, and you can start them right away from the right-click menu.";
/* Sources/DogMonitor/UI/DesktopSettingsView.swift:248 */
"단체 춤을 켜 두면 춤춰 줘·응원해 줘를 누르거나 집중을 잘 마쳤을 때처럼 축하할 일이 생기면 모든 친구가 10초 동안 같이 춤춰요." = "With Group dance on, every friend dances together for 10 seconds whenever there is something to celebrate, like Dance for me, Cheer me on or a focus session done well.";
/* Sources/DogMonitor/UI/DesktopSettingsView.swift:261 */
