"위쪽 띠를 끌어서 옮기고, ▾로 접어 띠만 남겨요. 동그라미로 색을 바꾸고, 휴지통으로 떼어요. 쓴 게 있으면 한 번 더 물어봐요." = "Drag the top strip to move it, and fold it with ▾ to leave just the strip. Change the color with the dots and peel it off with the trash can. If it has writing, you'll be asked once more.";
